WEBVTT

00:31.574 --> 00:35.124
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.144 --> 00:38.524
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.794 --> 00:44.764
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.924 --> 00:49.554
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.574 --> 00:53.084
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.104 --> 00:56.594
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.614 --> 01:00.124
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.144 --> 01:06.204
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.464 --> 01:23.744
Si Jin

01:23.764 --> 01:27.744
Episode 23

01:27.744 --> 01:30.424
(Zhou)

01:34.404 --> 01:36.314
By the decree of His Majesty,

01:36.434 --> 01:38.774
Yu Qi and Zhen Heng of Capital Security

01:38.794 --> 01:40.894
captured the killer.

01:40.914 --> 01:44.474
Yu Qi is thus granted the title

01:44.514 --> 01:46.754
of Guardian Contributor.

01:46.914 --> 01:50.184
Zhen Heng is thus granted the title

01:50.204 --> 01:51.964
of Righteous Contributor.

01:51.964 --> 01:53.054
The decree

01:53.074 --> 01:54.614
becomes effective upon arrival.

01:54.634 --> 01:56.034
Thank His Majesty.

02:13.364 --> 02:16.684
Your Majesty, it's likely connected to

02:16.804 --> 02:18.724
or orchestrated by the Nightingale.

02:19.964 --> 02:22.694
Nanwu has infiltrated Dazhou for years,

02:22.714 --> 02:25.124
and we've never been able
to root them out.

02:25.564 --> 02:28.074
Now, they've become even more brazen.

02:29.084 --> 02:30.254
Get to the bottom of it.

02:30.274 --> 02:31.634
Yes.

02:33.594 --> 02:34.954
Mr. Zhen.

02:35.274 --> 02:36.634
Mr. Zhen!

02:38.684 --> 02:40.844
Analyze this for me.

02:41.244 --> 02:43.284
With my performance today,

02:43.474 --> 02:46.384
how many ranks will I be promoted?

02:46.404 --> 02:48.244
In my opinion,

02:49.274 --> 02:51.284
the greatest merit today

02:51.314 --> 02:53.284
belongs to Commandant Yu.

02:53.844 --> 02:55.204
True.

02:57.754 --> 02:59.994
He's holding onto it
even while sleeping.

03:00.274 --> 03:03.504
Looks like a sachet.

03:03.524 --> 03:04.734
Could it be

03:04.754 --> 03:07.724
a keepsake from the girl he loves?

03:17.594 --> 03:18.544
Why...?

03:18.564 --> 03:19.964
What's wrong, Jiang?

03:21.994 --> 03:24.074
It looks a bit like the one

03:24.124 --> 03:25.454
my sister gave me.

03:25.474 --> 03:26.914
Your sister?

03:28.194 --> 03:29.554
Let me see.

03:31.474 --> 03:32.834
Is it the same?

03:33.434 --> 03:36.874
This sachet was made by the same person.

03:39.154 --> 03:40.524
Commandant Yu

03:40.714 --> 03:41.944
deserves it.

03:41.964 --> 03:44.354
Made by the same person?

03:44.404 --> 03:45.964
My sister made it for me...

03:51.644 --> 03:53.224
Yu Qi.

03:53.244 --> 03:54.154
Yu Qi!

03:54.154 --> 03:55.644
- That's my sister!
- Jiang!

03:55.644 --> 03:56.994
- Jiang!
- Yu Qi!

03:56.994 --> 03:58.004
He's still injured.

03:58.004 --> 04:00.304
(Border of Ling'an)

04:00.304 --> 04:03.824
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

04:12.844 --> 04:14.194
When solar eclipse happened,

04:14.194 --> 04:16.844
an Imperial Insignia Guard
tried to kill His Majesty.

04:17.804 --> 04:19.284
How is His Majesty?

04:19.564 --> 04:20.544
His Majesty is unharmed.

04:20.564 --> 04:21.724
Yu Qi of Capital Security

04:21.724 --> 04:23.284
got stabbed for him.

04:25.244 --> 04:26.604
Did he die?

04:26.684 --> 04:27.784
No.

04:27.804 --> 04:29.784
The imperial physician
treated him at once.

04:29.804 --> 04:32.704
Later, His Majesty
even summoned him privately to his tent.

04:32.994 --> 04:34.724
He protected the Emperor.

04:36.634 --> 04:38.404
What reward did he receive?

04:38.484 --> 04:39.804
He and Zhen Heng were granted

04:39.804 --> 04:41.144
an honorary title.

04:41.164 --> 04:43.094
There will be further rewards later.

04:47.834 --> 04:49.764
This isn't growing well.

05:13.044 --> 05:14.404
Your Majesty.

05:14.924 --> 05:16.644
Cui Xu is here.

05:19.314 --> 05:21.814
I wonder how his injuries are.

05:21.834 --> 05:23.194
Your Majesty,

05:23.394 --> 05:25.554
are you referring to the 7th Prince?

05:26.994 --> 05:30.324
I wonder if he still resents me.

05:30.564 --> 05:31.964
He won't.

05:39.564 --> 05:40.964
Summon him in.

05:46.284 --> 05:48.674
Greetings, Your Majesty.

05:48.834 --> 05:50.934
I've checked
every Imperial Insignia Guard

05:50.954 --> 05:53.144
to ensure they have a clean background

05:53.164 --> 05:54.614
with verifiable origins.

05:54.634 --> 05:56.544
All those who were present,

05:56.564 --> 05:57.614
including myself,

05:57.634 --> 05:59.024
have been recorded

05:59.044 --> 06:01.054
and shall be punished
based on responsibilities.

06:01.074 --> 06:02.794
Please review it, Your Majesty.

06:03.124 --> 06:05.114
What about Yu Qi?

06:05.834 --> 06:07.194
Yu Qi?

06:08.514 --> 06:09.874
Your Majesty,

06:10.164 --> 06:12.164
Yu Qi entered Capital Security

06:12.164 --> 06:13.394
through the Tournament

06:13.394 --> 06:15.024
not long ago.

06:15.044 --> 06:17.814
Even Zhen Heng, the pickiest one,

06:17.834 --> 06:19.374
has been working well with him.

06:19.394 --> 06:21.214
He's never impeached him.

06:22.954 --> 06:24.564
It seems Jin is doing well

06:24.564 --> 06:25.904
as the Right Commandant.

06:25.924 --> 06:27.174
Jin?

06:27.194 --> 06:28.754
Commandant Yu who protected

06:28.754 --> 06:30.904
His Majesty at the hunting grounds

06:30.924 --> 06:34.034
is the 7th Prince, Yu Jin.

06:34.194 --> 06:35.174
After all these years,

06:35.194 --> 06:36.784
only you were sent to see him,

06:36.804 --> 06:39.434
yet you didn't recognize him?

06:40.164 --> 06:41.494
Your Majesty.

06:41.514 --> 06:42.874
Here's the thing.

06:43.754 --> 06:44.924
The 7th Prince was far away

06:44.924 --> 06:46.464
in Yangui.

06:46.484 --> 06:48.814
Though you sent me to visit him,

06:48.834 --> 06:49.684
he always

06:49.684 --> 06:51.414
avoided meeting me.

06:51.434 --> 06:52.934
He'd only send messages

06:52.954 --> 06:54.784
from the military camp from afar.

06:54.804 --> 06:56.164
Forget it.

06:56.564 --> 06:58.844
For now, keep Jin's identity a secret.

06:59.194 --> 07:00.754
Since he is doing well

07:00.754 --> 07:02.234
in Capital Security,

07:02.394 --> 07:05.344
let him remain as the Right Commander

07:05.364 --> 07:07.144
to avoid controversy in court

07:07.164 --> 07:08.914
because of his return.

07:09.514 --> 07:11.404
Yes, Your Majesty.

07:17.434 --> 07:19.394
Come and take a look!

07:19.394 --> 07:20.604
The best in Ling'an!

07:20.604 --> 07:22.414
(Pastry)
Delicious Milk Cakes!

07:22.434 --> 07:24.784
His Majesty was nearly killed
at the hunting grounds.

07:24.804 --> 07:25.544
It seems

07:25.544 --> 07:27.144
it was Capital Security that saved him.

07:27.164 --> 07:28.714
Anyone bold enough to kill His Majesty

07:28.714 --> 07:30.214
must not have been easy to deal with.

07:30.224 --> 07:31.884
I heard that someone
from Capital Security

07:31.884 --> 07:33.294
was gravely wounded.

07:33.314 --> 07:34.634
Sir, this is yours.

07:34.634 --> 07:35.664
- Thank you.
- Sure.

07:35.684 --> 07:37.024
- Enjoy. Come again.
- Sure.

07:37.044 --> 07:39.294
- What would you like, Miss?
- He might not survive.

07:39.314 --> 07:40.674
Indeed.

07:41.394 --> 07:42.344
Manager,

07:42.364 --> 07:43.684
did a young lady come by earlier

07:43.684 --> 07:45.594
to reserve a box of Milk Cakes?

07:45.724 --> 07:46.614
This is yours.

07:46.634 --> 07:47.584
She said she was going

07:47.584 --> 07:48.724
to buy something else nearby

07:48.724 --> 07:50.494
and asked you to wait for her here.

07:50.514 --> 07:51.784
Thank you.

07:51.804 --> 07:53.164
Alright.

07:57.514 --> 07:58.874
Report!

07:59.604 --> 08:00.634
Mr. Zhen, Mr. Yu!

08:00.634 --> 08:01.614
It's bad!

08:01.634 --> 08:04.024
Sang Qi from the Nightingale
was poisoned in prison.

08:04.044 --> 08:06.224
He's about to die!

08:06.244 --> 08:07.604
What?

08:13.194 --> 08:14.104
How is he?

08:14.124 --> 08:15.104
My Lord.

08:15.124 --> 08:17.224
The poison has spread
throughout his body.

08:17.244 --> 08:18.584
His life is hanging by a thread.

08:18.604 --> 08:20.124
The antidote must be specific.

08:20.124 --> 08:20.844
I need to find out

08:20.844 --> 08:22.384
what poison he's been afflicted with.

08:22.404 --> 08:24.054
It should be his black scorpion.

08:24.074 --> 08:25.164
It was originally kept here,

08:25.164 --> 08:26.314
but when I found this,

08:26.314 --> 08:27.864
the scorpion was already gone.

08:27.884 --> 08:30.244
Physician, can you cure
this scorpion poison?

08:30.564 --> 08:32.024
There are many species of scorpions,

08:32.044 --> 08:33.214
with different poisons.

08:33.234 --> 08:34.904
I can't guarantee success,

08:34.924 --> 08:36.054
but I'll do my best

08:36.074 --> 08:37.624
to cure him.

08:37.644 --> 08:39.784
He's a major criminal.

08:39.804 --> 08:41.644
Please try your best.

08:42.114 --> 08:43.404
If you need anything,

08:43.404 --> 08:46.604
Capital Security
will offer full support.

08:56.834 --> 08:58.054
Miss,

08:58.074 --> 08:59.164
you've already added

08:59.164 --> 09:01.074
oriental sweetgum.

09:06.684 --> 09:09.744
Miss, should I fetch
some ink and brushes?

09:09.764 --> 09:11.124
You can paint.

09:11.354 --> 09:13.404
I can also accompany you for a walk.

09:15.194 --> 09:17.524
No need. It's fine.

09:18.004 --> 09:20.794
Are you worried about Commandant Yu?

09:25.684 --> 09:27.044
How about...

09:27.714 --> 09:29.194
Let's go to Zaoshu Lane

09:29.284 --> 09:32.434
and check on Er'niu.

09:32.684 --> 09:33.984
Let's see if its owner

09:34.004 --> 09:35.144
has returned.

09:35.164 --> 09:36.524
Alright.

10:01.344 --> 10:04.844
♪ Looking back,
I recall our first encounter ♪

10:04.864 --> 10:08.364
♪ Feelings remain
but things are complicated ♪

10:08.384 --> 10:11.624
♪ Thoughts replay ♪

10:11.984 --> 10:15.064
♪ I can't make up my mind ♪

10:15.624 --> 10:19.424
♪ Can I still make it
through the long night ♪

10:21.044 --> 10:22.404
(Yu Qi, )

10:22.644 --> 10:24.434
(you must return safely.)

10:26.144 --> 10:29.764
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

10:29.784 --> 10:33.644
♪ How many petals fell, I count ♪

10:33.664 --> 10:37.204
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

10:37.224 --> 10:40.904
♪ The past fades as old dreams return ♪

10:40.904 --> 10:44.384
♪ How can I move on ♪

10:44.404 --> 10:46.644
Miss, Er'niu is here to meet us.

10:48.004 --> 10:49.374
Let's go.

10:51.504 --> 10:55.264
♪ If love is strong,
one will have no fear ♪

10:55.264 --> 11:01.864
♪ During my lifetime ♪

11:01.924 --> 11:03.404
You're back.

11:07.194 --> 11:09.764
I went to your place looking for you.

11:09.884 --> 11:12.044
What are you doing here

11:12.044 --> 11:13.884
instead of staying in your room?

11:15.714 --> 11:17.284
I heard you were injured.

11:18.164 --> 11:20.334
Where were you hurt? Is it serious?

11:20.354 --> 11:21.784
It's not serious.

11:21.804 --> 11:23.194
You can ask him.

11:23.924 --> 11:26.384
Long Dan, where was Mr. Yu injured?

11:26.404 --> 11:27.764
He...

11:30.254 --> 11:31.394
Have you seen a physician?

11:31.414 --> 11:32.804
The imperial physician treated me.

11:32.804 --> 11:34.564
He said the wound was deep.

11:34.564 --> 11:36.714
Which eye of yours saw it was deep?

11:38.714 --> 11:40.074
Help me inside.

11:40.114 --> 11:41.474
Yes.

11:54.594 --> 11:59.794
♪ It's a long story;
we'll take different paths in this life ♪

12:02.714 --> 12:03.904
I'll make the medicine, Chief.

12:03.924 --> 12:05.284
No need.

12:06.234 --> 12:07.864
Boil some hot water instead.

12:08.804 --> 12:10.164
Alright.

12:11.054 --> 12:14.444
♪ I'll stop for you ♪

12:19.594 --> 12:21.144
When you were hurt before,

12:21.164 --> 12:22.074
you always acted

12:22.074 --> 12:24.054
like it was much worse.

12:24.074 --> 12:25.884
What's going on today?

12:26.234 --> 12:28.194
Why hide it from me?

12:29.114 --> 12:30.814
Just now, Long Dan said

12:30.834 --> 12:33.334
the imperial physician said
your wound was deep.

12:34.044 --> 12:36.004
Why didn't you tell me?

12:36.474 --> 12:38.354
Do you know how worried I was

12:38.354 --> 12:40.034
when I found out this morning?

12:41.004 --> 12:42.884
Yu Qi, was this intentional?

12:44.284 --> 12:45.644
Didn't you say before

12:45.644 --> 12:46.564
you were going

12:46.564 --> 12:48.404
to protect me?

12:48.594 --> 12:50.294
Why lie to me?

12:50.314 --> 12:51.634
I thought I'd never see you again

12:51.634 --> 12:53.604
in this lifetime.

12:55.384 --> 13:01.024
♪ Forgetting the past,
how many can make it ♪

13:02.144 --> 13:08.994
♪ Looking at the past,
there was dew on the mayfly ♪

13:09.074 --> 13:15.524
♪ In this lifetime,
I only want to be with you ♪

13:15.714 --> 13:17.764
I said I won't eat it.

13:22.184 --> 13:24.944
(Dignified and Delicate)

13:35.434 --> 13:37.474
Since returning from Lingshui,

13:37.474 --> 13:39.524
you've been making a scene

13:39.564 --> 13:41.624
by beating the servants
and smashing cups

13:41.644 --> 13:43.604
to vent your frustration.

13:44.404 --> 13:46.644
Where are your manners
as the Commandery Princess?

13:46.644 --> 13:48.364
Mother, don't you remember?

13:48.434 --> 13:49.314
My title was already

13:49.314 --> 13:50.764
stripped away.

13:53.194 --> 13:56.164
His Majesty has tacitly agreed
to your return.

13:56.474 --> 13:58.814
You only need to stay by my side

13:58.834 --> 14:00.434
for a while,

14:01.644 --> 14:03.164
and I promise

14:03.284 --> 14:04.784
my precious daughter

14:04.804 --> 14:05.764
will be

14:05.764 --> 14:07.504
a Commandery Princess again.

14:07.524 --> 14:08.884
Okay?

14:10.044 --> 14:12.094
Who cares about that title?

14:12.114 --> 14:14.434
What do you want then?

14:17.764 --> 14:20.484
I want Jiang Si to die.

14:30.884 --> 14:32.244
Mother,

14:32.884 --> 14:35.314
you've never hit me.

14:36.764 --> 14:39.074
Do you no longer like me either?

14:45.714 --> 14:47.984
It's my fault for bad parenting.

14:50.074 --> 14:52.364
The more you want something,

14:52.404 --> 14:54.884
the less you should ask for it directly.

14:55.044 --> 14:57.284
You're too reckless with your words.

14:59.434 --> 15:02.764
Aren't you afraid
of stirring up trouble again?

15:08.044 --> 15:11.314
Your Highness,
the County Princess is still young

15:11.314 --> 15:13.674
and needs to be taught gradually.

15:13.954 --> 15:16.074
Don't be too hasty.

15:17.404 --> 15:19.914
It's time to find her a husband.

15:20.434 --> 15:21.794
Once she's married,

15:21.884 --> 15:23.914
maybe she'll become more sensible.

15:28.404 --> 15:30.074
Married?

15:32.594 --> 15:34.364
Since you mentioned that...

15:36.524 --> 15:37.884
Mother,

15:39.004 --> 15:41.194
you lost to Su Ke.

15:42.564 --> 15:44.794
I'll make sure to win

15:45.954 --> 15:47.604
against Jiang Si for you.

15:50.564 --> 15:52.794
Ouch! It hurts!

15:53.234 --> 15:53.994
It hurts so much!

15:54.014 --> 15:55.524
You're an Imperial Insignia Guard now,

15:55.524 --> 15:57.064
but your progress seems limited.

15:57.084 --> 15:58.454
Gentlemen don't fight with women.

15:58.454 --> 16:00.284
I'm just letting you win.

16:00.354 --> 16:01.434
Stop, stop. Please stop.

16:01.434 --> 16:03.124
I give up. Please spare me.

16:07.114 --> 16:08.054
Why don't you understand

16:08.054 --> 16:09.814
how to cherish a delicate man?

16:11.234 --> 16:12.764
Come on.

16:12.954 --> 16:15.544
I just finished a dangerous mission,

16:15.564 --> 16:17.454
and you didn't care about me at all.

16:17.474 --> 16:19.574
All you want to do is spar.

16:19.594 --> 16:21.164
His Majesty being assassinated

16:21.164 --> 16:22.694
has been spread through the city.

16:22.714 --> 16:24.334
I know how skilled Qi is.

16:24.354 --> 16:25.424
As for you,

16:25.444 --> 16:26.714
if you don't practice diligently

16:26.714 --> 16:27.814
and make rapid progress,

16:27.834 --> 16:29.234
what will you do

16:29.234 --> 16:30.794
if danger comes again?

16:35.044 --> 16:36.764
I understand now.

16:38.354 --> 16:40.434
You're worried about me.

16:42.404 --> 16:44.314
Can you be more serious?

16:45.194 --> 16:46.884
You've hit my

16:47.684 --> 16:49.834
fatal spot!

16:56.804 --> 16:58.134
Stop pretending.

16:58.154 --> 16:59.464
This old trick again.

16:59.484 --> 17:01.574
I'm getting tired of it if you are not.

17:02.634 --> 17:04.844
Jiang Zhan, get up.

17:06.524 --> 17:09.474
Jiang Zhan, I'm telling you to get up.

17:14.004 --> 17:15.364
Jiang Zhan?

17:17.914 --> 17:19.274
Jiang Zhan?

17:22.284 --> 17:23.644
Jiang Zhan.

17:25.314 --> 17:26.394
Wake up, Jiang Zhan!

17:26.394 --> 17:27.844
What's wrong with you?

17:27.914 --> 17:29.274
Jiang Zhan!

17:30.114 --> 17:31.224
Jiang Zhan!

17:31.244 --> 17:33.054
Jiang Zhan, what's happening?

17:33.074 --> 17:34.154
Jiang Zhan, wake up!

17:34.154 --> 17:35.854
What's wrong with you?

17:35.874 --> 17:37.234
Jiang Zhan!

17:37.354 --> 17:38.884
Jiang Zhan!

17:40.394 --> 17:43.084
You're so worried about me.

17:44.044 --> 17:45.604
Are you crazy?

17:46.004 --> 17:47.354
You really hit

17:47.354 --> 17:49.164
my fatal spot.

17:51.204 --> 17:53.364
How can you hit me so hard?

17:57.674 --> 17:59.034
Are you angry?

18:07.394 --> 18:10.124
I was just playing with you.

18:19.114 --> 18:20.114
I...

18:20.114 --> 18:22.094
I won't scare you again.

18:22.114 --> 18:23.474
I'm sorry.

18:27.154 --> 18:29.714
Sorry. Have a cherry.

18:31.524 --> 18:32.914
Please forgive me.

18:47.484 --> 18:49.134
This poison is too tricky.

18:49.154 --> 18:50.814
I couldn't save him.

18:50.834 --> 18:53.714
The trail is lost again.

18:55.484 --> 18:56.844
It's fine.

18:57.044 --> 18:58.744
Nothing can be done

18:58.764 --> 19:00.094
without a trace.

19:00.114 --> 19:01.604
We can find more clues.

19:03.964 --> 19:06.094
This scorpion poison
might be contagious.

19:06.114 --> 19:07.764
The body shouldn't stay out
for too long.

19:07.764 --> 19:09.194
Let's bury it first.

19:15.394 --> 19:16.814
Let's go raid their stronghold

19:16.834 --> 19:18.644
(Tianxiang House)
for any clues.

19:22.804 --> 19:24.594
What's going on here?

19:24.594 --> 19:25.544
What happened?

19:25.564 --> 19:26.574
This...

19:26.594 --> 19:28.564
My Lord, I...

19:38.964 --> 19:39.944
My Lord.

19:39.964 --> 19:41.244
This is just a tavern.

19:41.244 --> 19:43.124
Is there a misunderstanding?

19:44.874 --> 19:47.004
I'm innocent, My Lord.

19:47.004 --> 19:48.354
Chief, Liu Yan'er ran away

19:48.354 --> 19:49.614
and only left this.

19:49.634 --> 19:50.994
My Lord...

19:55.444 --> 19:56.814
Liu Yan'er's veil

19:56.834 --> 19:58.374
and the killer's handkerchief

19:58.394 --> 20:00.164
were made by the same person.

20:00.564 --> 20:02.574
How dare you harbor a fugitive?

20:02.594 --> 20:05.024
Tell me. Where is Liu Yan'er?

20:05.044 --> 20:06.184
My Lord,

20:06.204 --> 20:08.234
it has nothing to do with me.

20:08.524 --> 20:10.284
Liu Yan'er's long stopped
receiving guests.

20:10.284 --> 20:12.024
I don't know where she went.

20:12.044 --> 20:13.244
I really don't know

20:13.244 --> 20:14.944
her background.

20:14.964 --> 20:16.324
She works here.

20:16.354 --> 20:17.804
You'd better come clean.

20:18.074 --> 20:19.204
It was she

20:19.204 --> 20:21.134
who came here.

20:21.154 --> 20:22.874
She was pretty,

20:22.874 --> 20:24.294
could make fragrances,

20:24.314 --> 20:25.854
and had a tragic past,

20:25.874 --> 20:28.044
so I took her in.

20:28.244 --> 20:29.294
If I had known

20:29.314 --> 20:31.194
she'd commit such a huge crime,

20:31.214 --> 20:32.634
I wouldn't have dared to take her in

20:32.634 --> 20:34.604
even if I was much bolder.

20:34.874 --> 20:36.234
Good for her.

20:36.354 --> 20:37.944
She left so soon

20:37.964 --> 20:39.594
without any clues left.

20:39.614 --> 20:42.034
Tell everyone to hunt for Liu Yan'er
and Du'er. Let's leave.

20:42.034 --> 20:43.514
Yes. Leave!

21:17.074 --> 21:18.094
When you wake up,

21:18.114 --> 21:20.184
go to the temple outside the West Gate.

21:31.964 --> 21:33.134
Right now, Tianxiang House

21:33.154 --> 21:34.854
is guarded by Capital Security.

21:34.874 --> 21:36.714
I'm afraid we can't go back there.

21:37.124 --> 21:38.784
We should find another place to stay.

21:38.804 --> 21:39.784
It's cold at night.

21:39.804 --> 21:41.374
I'm worried about your health.

21:41.394 --> 21:42.754
I'm fine.

21:45.074 --> 21:46.734
Let's wait a little longer.

21:48.834 --> 21:50.474
I wonder if Jiang Si

21:51.044 --> 21:52.804
can save Junior Sang.

21:54.444 --> 21:56.244
Remember to wait
for Sang Qi at the temple

21:56.244 --> 21:57.704
outside the West Gate.

22:00.674 --> 22:02.034
I think

22:02.154 --> 22:03.804
Jiang Si can't be trusted.

22:04.444 --> 22:05.764
She pretended to be one of us

22:05.764 --> 22:07.134
to trick us,

22:07.154 --> 22:08.094
and now she's trying

22:08.114 --> 22:09.994
to help us rescue Junior Sang.

22:10.154 --> 22:12.804
It's hard to tell
whether she's a friend or foe.

22:13.394 --> 22:15.364
But when she urged me to escape,

22:15.564 --> 22:17.274
she looked flustered,

22:17.834 --> 22:19.374
and it didn't seem fake.

22:19.484 --> 22:21.644
So, if we don't do what she wants,

22:21.674 --> 22:24.044
or give up the plan,
would she still help us?

22:28.574 --> 22:29.814
- Junior Sang.
- Junior Sang.

22:29.834 --> 22:31.364
- Hurry.
- Senior Liu.

22:31.524 --> 22:32.744
Senior Du.

22:32.764 --> 22:34.124
Senior...

22:34.204 --> 22:35.744
- Who are you?
- Slowly.

22:37.114 --> 22:38.714
- Sit down.
- You...

22:39.354 --> 22:40.294
She...

22:40.314 --> 22:42.954
She asked me to come here.

22:43.484 --> 22:44.844
I didn't expect

22:44.914 --> 22:46.564
you two to really be here.

22:50.284 --> 22:51.854
Jiang Si saved you?

22:51.874 --> 22:53.234
Who?

22:53.674 --> 22:55.034
Jiang Si?

22:56.244 --> 22:57.844
Who's Jiang Si?

23:00.914 --> 23:02.334
Are you talking

23:02.354 --> 23:04.954
about that pretty girl?

23:06.244 --> 23:07.914
Yes, that's her.

23:10.564 --> 23:12.914
Is she really one of us?

23:14.284 --> 23:15.814
We sent several teams

23:15.834 --> 23:17.574
but couldn't rescue you.

23:17.594 --> 23:18.784
She's just a girl

23:18.804 --> 23:20.094
who can't even kill a chicken.

23:20.114 --> 23:22.124
How did she break you out?

23:22.244 --> 23:23.504
Break me out?

23:23.524 --> 23:25.324
She didn't break me out.

23:27.354 --> 23:28.984
The prison guard

23:29.004 --> 23:30.614
just brought her in,

23:30.634 --> 23:31.994
and she...

23:32.204 --> 23:33.504
She...

23:33.524 --> 23:35.994
She pretended to talk

23:36.484 --> 23:38.274
and saved

23:38.484 --> 23:39.884
my scorpion.

23:42.244 --> 23:44.044
What does she want to do?

23:44.244 --> 23:46.094
Senior Du.

23:46.114 --> 23:47.464
I remember now.

23:47.484 --> 23:48.424
I remember it.

23:48.444 --> 23:49.334
After I woke up,

23:49.354 --> 23:50.944
I found this beside me.

23:50.964 --> 23:52.324
Look.

23:53.114 --> 23:55.144
The Grand Elder's bamboo leaf letter.

23:59.044 --> 24:00.804
What do you think, Senior Du?

24:02.524 --> 24:04.604
The Grand Elder wants us back to Nanwu.

24:04.764 --> 24:06.124
What?

24:06.484 --> 24:07.954
Did the Grand Elder

24:08.394 --> 24:10.404
really send Jiang Si here?

24:14.524 --> 24:16.134
The Nightingale is exposed.

24:16.154 --> 24:17.374
I'm afraid

24:17.394 --> 24:19.644
we're hunted in Ling'an now.

24:20.354 --> 24:21.654
It's better to go back.

24:21.674 --> 24:23.054
We'll know the truth

24:23.074 --> 24:24.504
of this mystery

24:24.524 --> 24:26.214
once we see the Grand Elder.

24:28.384 --> 24:30.944
(Capital Security)

24:33.154 --> 24:34.514
What happened?

24:34.574 --> 24:35.524
I don't know.

24:35.524 --> 24:36.884
Let's go check.

24:39.384 --> 24:41.784
(Hunting Order)

24:41.804 --> 24:43.194
A Hunting Order.

24:47.264 --> 24:54.744
(Hunting Order)

24:58.724 --> 25:00.084
Long Dan.

25:00.834 --> 25:02.474
- Long Dan.
- Yes?

25:03.484 --> 25:04.424
Chief.

25:04.444 --> 25:06.134
Go to the same

25:06.154 --> 25:07.514
Milk Cake Shop.

25:08.284 --> 25:10.374
Don't slack off this time.

25:10.394 --> 25:12.564
Wait a little longer. I want fresh ones.

25:13.284 --> 25:15.274
It's for Miss Jiang.

25:16.674 --> 25:18.034
I understand.

25:18.394 --> 25:19.754
Let's go.

25:20.204 --> 25:21.564
Commandant Yu.

25:24.724 --> 25:26.994
Don't you think Sang Qi's death

25:27.204 --> 25:28.714
is a little suspicious?

25:28.764 --> 25:30.124
Is there a lead?

25:30.154 --> 25:32.944
I remember this scorpion box

25:32.964 --> 25:35.364
was pressed under stone bricks.

25:35.724 --> 25:36.664
How could it have been

25:36.674 --> 25:38.514
so easy to escape from?

25:41.764 --> 25:43.124
Right.

25:43.154 --> 25:44.744
Also, I heard

25:44.764 --> 25:46.294
Miss Jiang Si

25:46.314 --> 25:47.674
recently went to the prison.

25:47.674 --> 25:48.634
She went to the prison?

25:48.634 --> 25:49.994
Yes,

25:50.284 --> 25:52.114
and she used your badge.

25:52.114 --> 25:54.164
That's impossible. My badge is...

26:06.444 --> 26:07.444
Do you think it's her?

26:07.444 --> 26:08.704
No.

26:08.724 --> 26:10.224
That's not what I meant.

26:10.244 --> 26:11.714
I know

26:11.914 --> 26:13.914
it was after Miss Jiang left

26:14.114 --> 26:15.844
that Sang Qi died.

26:16.244 --> 26:17.804
But your badge...

26:17.804 --> 26:19.164
Don't worry.

26:20.044 --> 26:21.874
There will never be a next time.

26:22.914 --> 26:24.274
Alright.

26:25.484 --> 26:26.844
I believe you.

26:54.024 --> 26:54.914
(Peace)
Commandant Yu,

26:54.914 --> 26:56.114
our lady really isn't here.

26:56.114 --> 26:57.374
You really can't go in.

26:57.394 --> 26:59.234
I saw it. She's really not here.

27:03.394 --> 27:05.054
This poison is too tricky.

27:05.074 --> 27:06.674
I couldn't save him.

27:07.524 --> 27:09.124
Why did you come suddenly?

27:10.114 --> 27:11.674
I thought

27:11.674 --> 27:13.234
you'd want this.

27:13.314 --> 27:15.284
Why is the physician here?

27:15.284 --> 27:16.744
Are you feeling unwell?

27:16.974 --> 27:18.504
Did you come all this way

27:18.524 --> 27:19.944
just to deliver the Milk Cakes?

27:19.964 --> 27:21.324
I'm happy.

27:23.354 --> 27:24.944
Since I got back from the hunt...

27:24.964 --> 27:26.024
Let's go.

27:26.044 --> 27:28.044
I've been especially happy.

27:28.244 --> 27:30.224
Why are you in such a good mood?

27:30.244 --> 27:32.024
Have you heard of someone
who trains hawks

27:32.044 --> 27:34.194
and has the hawk peck out their eyes?

27:34.354 --> 27:35.884
What do you mean?

27:36.074 --> 27:38.474
I just learned about someone

27:38.564 --> 27:40.004
who was poisoned to death

27:40.004 --> 27:41.364
by his scorpion.

27:41.724 --> 27:43.044
The scorpion must know

27:43.044 --> 27:45.024
the laws of Dazhou,

27:45.044 --> 27:47.124
so it would know where to strike.

27:47.444 --> 27:48.994
That's quite interesting.

27:51.914 --> 27:53.954
Here's something even more interesting:

27:54.634 --> 27:56.234
It seems

27:56.394 --> 27:58.404
my badge has grown legs,

27:58.674 --> 28:00.604
and when I wasn't paying attention,

28:00.724 --> 28:02.564
it went to the prison on its own.

28:03.634 --> 28:05.234
Commandant Yu,

28:05.284 --> 28:06.944
what do you want to know from me?

28:06.964 --> 28:08.394
Miss Jiang, don't you have something

28:08.394 --> 28:10.124
you want to tell me?

28:14.594 --> 28:15.954
Yes.

28:16.114 --> 28:17.854
I took your badge,

28:17.874 --> 28:19.644
I bribed the physician,

28:19.834 --> 28:21.434
and naturally,

28:21.804 --> 28:23.274
I let Sang Qi go.

28:23.354 --> 28:24.714
But

28:25.004 --> 28:26.714
I have my reasons.

28:27.484 --> 28:28.444
What reasons?

28:28.444 --> 28:29.984
Sit down, and let's talk.

28:36.394 --> 28:37.504
Dazhou and Nanwu

28:37.524 --> 28:39.544
have been in constant warfare for years,

28:39.564 --> 28:41.804
but who is the true victor?

28:42.764 --> 28:44.574
You fought on the frontlines,

28:44.594 --> 28:46.884
so you should understand better
than anyone

28:46.914 --> 28:49.844
that killing doesn't solve any problems,

28:49.874 --> 28:51.614
and it only causes the people

28:51.634 --> 28:52.784
to suffer more.

28:52.804 --> 28:53.744
So,

28:53.764 --> 28:55.504
I let Sang Qi go

28:55.524 --> 28:57.544
to find a better way forward.

28:57.564 --> 28:58.924
What way?

28:59.634 --> 29:01.044
Do you understand them,

29:01.044 --> 29:02.474
or have you been there?

29:02.914 --> 29:04.264
I may not be like you

29:04.284 --> 29:06.514
who's led troops at the border,

29:06.564 --> 29:08.124
but I understand

29:08.384 --> 29:10.104
that there are losers
and winners in wars.

29:10.114 --> 29:11.334
But after the war,

29:11.354 --> 29:13.054
there are no true winners.

29:13.074 --> 29:14.294
Once the war begins,

29:14.314 --> 29:15.614
there will be death and injury.

29:15.634 --> 29:17.424
And behind every death or injury,

29:17.444 --> 29:19.564
there is a broken family.

29:19.674 --> 29:20.834
Letting Sang Qi go

29:20.834 --> 29:22.224
was to find out

29:22.244 --> 29:24.094
why they came

29:24.114 --> 29:25.714
and what they wanted to do.

29:26.004 --> 29:28.954
Are you discussing
military strategies with me now?

29:29.674 --> 29:32.464
If you know yourself and your enemy,
you'll win every battle.

29:32.484 --> 29:33.994
In the future,

29:34.074 --> 29:35.654
if more people

29:35.674 --> 29:37.054
from Nanwu and Dazhou

29:37.074 --> 29:38.784
are willing to understand each other,

29:38.804 --> 29:39.834
does that mean grudges

29:39.834 --> 29:40.804
can be resolved

29:40.804 --> 29:42.264
and peace can be achieved?

29:42.284 --> 29:43.704
If the two sides

29:43.724 --> 29:45.944
could understand each other,

29:45.964 --> 29:47.994
maybe we won't need a battle.

29:54.914 --> 29:56.274
That's interesting.

29:57.044 --> 29:58.404
Now, tell me.

29:58.874 --> 30:00.004
Did you come to find me

30:00.004 --> 30:02.224
to return the badge

30:02.244 --> 30:05.194
or just to see me?

30:09.044 --> 30:11.164
Since you've come to accuse me,

30:11.244 --> 30:13.474
I have no choice but to be honest.

30:18.874 --> 30:20.514
I went to find you that day

30:21.074 --> 30:24.194
to return the badge.

30:29.634 --> 30:31.364
I don't believe that.

30:31.594 --> 30:32.994
I don't care.

30:38.674 --> 30:40.034
Turn around.

30:40.564 --> 30:41.924
And you...

30:59.454 --> 31:03.134
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

31:03.134 --> 31:07.214
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

31:07.454 --> 31:09.194
♪ Like shadows ♪

31:09.214 --> 31:13.914
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

31:13.914 --> 31:17.484
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

31:17.504 --> 31:21.734
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

31:21.754 --> 31:24.044
♪ Time glows ♪

31:24.064 --> 31:27.624
(Tiande Hall)

31:28.354 --> 31:29.834
Your Majesty, this is the 7th Prince

31:29.834 --> 31:32.274
painted by the painter this year.

31:32.764 --> 31:34.714
It's just like him.

31:35.204 --> 31:37.094
But after seeing the real person,

31:37.114 --> 31:39.234
I think the man

31:39.724 --> 31:40.724
in the painting

31:40.724 --> 31:42.704
looks less gallant.

31:42.724 --> 31:44.854
The 7th Prince is handsome and elegant,

31:44.874 --> 31:47.914
so a painting can never
fully capture him.

31:50.114 --> 31:51.004
His brothers

31:51.004 --> 31:53.274
live in luxury in Ling'an,

31:54.004 --> 31:56.644
but no one cares for him,

31:56.674 --> 31:59.754
and he has to grow up alone
in the South.

32:00.634 --> 32:02.714
He turned out so handsome.

32:03.524 --> 32:04.884
Over these years,

32:04.914 --> 32:07.254
he must've suffered a lot.

32:07.274 --> 32:08.114
For all these years,

32:08.114 --> 32:10.374
you've never forgotten the 7th Prince.

32:10.394 --> 32:12.474
You had people teach him skills

32:12.524 --> 32:14.984
and had paintings sent back every year.

32:15.004 --> 32:17.134
You care about him so much.

32:17.154 --> 32:19.594
The 7th Prince
must've certainly felt it.

32:19.594 --> 32:21.404
Report!

32:22.724 --> 32:23.944
Your Majesty,

32:23.964 --> 32:26.044
Mr. Zhen and Mr. Yu are here.

32:26.074 --> 32:27.224
Let them in.

32:27.244 --> 32:28.604
Yes.

32:28.914 --> 32:30.274
Let them in.

32:41.244 --> 32:44.044
I'm Zhen Heng. Greetings, Your Majesty.

32:45.524 --> 32:48.134
I'm Yu Qi. Greetings, Your Majesty.

32:48.154 --> 32:49.514
Rise.

32:49.914 --> 32:51.214
I ordered you to investigate

32:51.214 --> 32:53.094
the assassination
at the Mid-Autumn Festival.

32:53.114 --> 32:54.644
Is there any progress?

32:55.284 --> 32:56.644
Your Majesty.

32:56.674 --> 32:58.094
Wang Heng, Imperial Insignia Guard,

32:58.114 --> 32:59.124
Aling, Palace Woman,

32:59.144 --> 33:00.614
and Zhou Yi, Vice Minister of Rites,

33:00.634 --> 33:02.184
have been thoroughly interrogated.

33:02.204 --> 33:03.334
Their confessions

33:03.354 --> 33:05.054
confirm that the assassination

33:05.074 --> 33:06.864
was indeed orchestrated
by the Nightingale.

33:06.884 --> 33:09.134
Now, the Nightingale's stronghold

33:09.154 --> 33:10.784
in Ling'an has been purged,

33:10.804 --> 33:12.234
but two major criminals

33:12.594 --> 33:14.234
are still being hunted.

33:15.454 --> 33:16.784
Zhen,

33:16.804 --> 33:18.404
I trust your work.

33:18.914 --> 33:20.544
Your Majesty, I have a question.

33:20.564 --> 33:21.274
What is it?

33:21.294 --> 33:23.444
The Imperial Insignia Guard
and Speed Guards present

33:23.444 --> 33:24.884
were all elites,

33:24.964 --> 33:26.354
and with Cui Xu and Han Ran

33:26.354 --> 33:28.124
commanding,

33:28.284 --> 33:30.184
why was there no one to protect you

33:30.204 --> 33:31.744
during the assassination?

33:31.764 --> 33:34.464
I have punished Cui Xu and Han Ran

33:34.484 --> 33:36.024
for their dereliction of duty.

33:36.044 --> 33:37.544
Apart from them,

33:37.564 --> 33:39.984
others who were absent

33:40.004 --> 33:41.884
should also be held accountable,

33:43.284 --> 33:46.164
such as the Directorate of Astronomy.

33:46.834 --> 33:47.984
If they failed

33:48.004 --> 33:50.784
to predict the solar eclipse,

33:50.804 --> 33:51.874
they are negligent.

33:51.874 --> 33:53.074
If they did predict it

33:53.074 --> 33:54.894
and failed to report it,

33:54.914 --> 33:56.504
it means they lied to you.

33:56.524 --> 33:59.054
They should be punished accordingly.

33:59.074 --> 34:00.434
Well said.

34:00.564 --> 34:02.164
As expected of my...

34:03.674 --> 34:05.644
My Commandant of Capital Security.

34:08.044 --> 34:09.134
Baoping.

34:09.154 --> 34:10.514
Yes, Your Majesty.

34:11.594 --> 34:13.714
When I returned last night,

34:13.754 --> 34:16.254
I ordered
the Directorate to be searched,

34:16.274 --> 34:17.654
and this letter was found.

34:17.674 --> 34:19.034
Take a look.

34:20.964 --> 34:22.724
What kind of language is this?

34:23.044 --> 34:24.384
It's the Nanwu language.

34:24.404 --> 34:25.654
It speaks

34:25.674 --> 34:27.344
of the concealed matter.

34:27.364 --> 34:28.424
The Nanwu language

34:28.444 --> 34:30.564
is a forbidden language in Dazhou.

34:33.674 --> 34:34.514
Your Majesty,

34:34.524 --> 34:36.134
I've spent lots of time with Mr. Yu,

34:36.154 --> 34:38.174
and I swear with my reputation

34:38.194 --> 34:39.394
that he is loyal to the country

34:39.404 --> 34:41.194
and will never betray Dazhou.

34:41.224 --> 34:42.544
Your Majesty, please believe me.

34:42.564 --> 34:44.574
Zhen, you may leave.

34:44.594 --> 34:45.504
Your Majesty...

34:45.524 --> 34:46.864
Leave now.

34:46.884 --> 34:48.244
Yes.

35:07.564 --> 35:09.834
How good you're at winning people over.

35:10.634 --> 35:12.864
You've even melted

35:12.884 --> 35:15.674
a tough stone like Zhen Heng

35:15.714 --> 35:17.254
in such a short time.

35:17.274 --> 35:20.604
That's because Mr. Zhen is righteous.

35:21.364 --> 35:23.304
Jin, tell me.

35:23.324 --> 35:25.734
How did you learn the Nanwu language?

35:25.754 --> 35:27.974
I taught myself
while stationed in Nanwu.

35:28.154 --> 35:30.154
I suppose it was to know your enemy

35:30.154 --> 35:31.824
and gain an advantage in wars.

35:31.844 --> 35:34.794
At first, it was indeed to win battles,

35:34.814 --> 35:36.324
but someone

35:36.324 --> 35:38.124
changed my mind.

35:38.594 --> 35:39.954
Who is it?

35:41.404 --> 35:42.874
A friend.

35:44.154 --> 35:46.904
She believes that knowing your enemy

35:46.924 --> 35:48.574
is for winning without fighting.

35:48.594 --> 35:50.504
There are losers and winners in wars,

35:50.524 --> 35:52.944
but there won't be true winners.

35:52.964 --> 35:54.424
Once the war begins,

35:54.444 --> 35:55.774
there will be death and injury.

35:55.794 --> 35:57.544
And behind every death or injury,

35:57.564 --> 35:59.774
there is a broken family.

35:59.794 --> 36:01.734
If more people from Dazhou

36:01.754 --> 36:02.964
and Nanwu

36:02.964 --> 36:04.574
can understand each other,

36:04.594 --> 36:06.824
our accumulated grudges
will be resolved,

36:06.844 --> 36:08.054
and we will live in peace.

36:08.074 --> 36:09.594
For both sides,

36:09.594 --> 36:12.124
that'd be winning without fighting.

36:13.674 --> 36:16.274
This friend of yours really is a talent.

36:16.384 --> 36:17.654
It's a pity she's in the South,

36:17.674 --> 36:20.124
otherwise, I'd really like to meet her.

36:20.154 --> 36:21.424
Perhaps you will one day.

36:21.444 --> 36:22.574
Your Majesty,

36:22.594 --> 36:24.984
lunch is ready at Jinhua Hall.

36:25.004 --> 36:27.024
Come on, join me

36:27.044 --> 36:28.174
for a meal before you leave.

36:28.194 --> 36:29.404
You can meet with Consort Xian.

36:29.404 --> 36:32.054
You said I could continue being Yu Qi.

36:32.074 --> 36:33.824
I allowed you to be Yu Qi

36:33.844 --> 36:37.254
but never said
you could deny your parents.

36:37.274 --> 36:38.634
Let's go.

36:54.264 --> 36:57.904
(Grand Elder, Nanwu)

36:59.114 --> 37:00.464
Grand Elder.

37:00.484 --> 37:01.924
Why have you returned?

37:02.674 --> 37:03.514
Grand Elder,

37:03.524 --> 37:05.214
wasn't it your bamboo leaf letter

37:05.234 --> 37:07.084
that summoned us back to Nanwu?

37:07.364 --> 37:09.124
I summoned you?

37:11.004 --> 37:12.364
Look at this letter.

37:17.754 --> 37:20.124
The handwriting is mine,

37:20.154 --> 37:21.504
but this letter

37:21.524 --> 37:23.004
was not written by me.

37:23.234 --> 37:25.654
Could someone have imitated
your handwriting?

37:25.674 --> 37:27.044
Where did you

37:27.194 --> 37:29.084
get this letter from?

37:29.754 --> 37:31.694
This is truly strange.

37:31.714 --> 37:34.644
Sang Qi was imprisoned
by Dazhou back then...

37:37.114 --> 37:38.834
Besides that,

37:39.594 --> 37:42.164
she seemed to be able
to foresee many things.

37:45.044 --> 37:47.354
Who exactly is she?

37:48.564 --> 37:50.084
I investigated her.

37:50.364 --> 37:52.984
She was born and raised in Dazhou,

37:53.004 --> 37:54.544
has never left Ling'an,

37:54.564 --> 37:55.544
and has no connection

37:55.564 --> 37:57.564
to Nanwu whatsoever.

37:58.004 --> 37:59.304
Yet somehow,

37:59.324 --> 38:01.524
it felt like she had long known us.

38:02.154 --> 38:03.754
Is that so?

38:04.524 --> 38:05.634
Grand Elder,

38:05.654 --> 38:07.544
our oracle states

38:07.564 --> 38:09.444
that the Saintess can foresee the future

38:09.444 --> 38:11.194
and know everything.

38:11.444 --> 38:12.544
Jiang Si

38:12.564 --> 38:14.374
seems to match that description.

38:15.074 --> 38:17.964
Could she be related to the Saintess?

38:18.114 --> 38:19.134
Or perhaps...

38:19.154 --> 38:21.044
She is the Saintess?

38:24.674 --> 38:26.314
What about Sang Qi and Du'er?

38:26.464 --> 38:27.484
We are wanted by Dazhou,

38:27.484 --> 38:28.944
so they stayed to cover our retreat.

38:28.964 --> 38:30.324
Tell them

38:30.714 --> 38:32.504
that once this is over,

38:32.524 --> 38:34.254
they must return to Dazhou at once

38:34.274 --> 38:36.274
and bring the Saintess back.

38:37.714 --> 38:39.074
Yes.

38:49.504 --> 38:52.464
(Consort Xian, Yu Jin's birth mother)

38:55.844 --> 38:57.234
Your Majesty,

38:57.404 --> 38:59.614
when you asked Yu Jin
to return to Ling'an,

38:59.634 --> 39:01.874
you could've told me in advance,

39:02.674 --> 39:05.274
so I could've prepared for this.

39:05.924 --> 39:07.144
There wasn't enough time today

39:07.154 --> 39:09.214
to summon Prince Qi to the Palace.

39:09.234 --> 39:12.384
He's always been decent and composed.

39:12.404 --> 39:14.274
He's kind to his siblings as well.

39:15.524 --> 39:17.044
When you meet him,

39:17.674 --> 39:19.294
I'm sure you'll be pleased.

39:20.044 --> 39:21.944
Even after years apart,

39:21.964 --> 39:23.694
your bond is in your very blood.

39:23.714 --> 39:25.074
Why would a mother need to prepare

39:25.094 --> 39:26.744
for a meeting with her son?

39:27.524 --> 39:29.234
You're right, Your Majesty.

39:36.884 --> 39:40.164
This drink is to welcome you back.

39:40.194 --> 39:41.644
I don't drink alcohol.

39:45.524 --> 39:46.694
Then have some food.

39:46.714 --> 39:47.904
These dishes

39:47.924 --> 39:50.134
were prepared especially for you.

39:50.154 --> 39:51.424
I haven't recovered.

39:51.444 --> 39:54.164
I'm afraid I can't have meat.

40:01.074 --> 40:02.424
Look at you.

40:02.444 --> 40:04.424
You don't even know your own son.

40:04.444 --> 40:06.484
There's much to learn.

40:07.074 --> 40:09.644
Jin, don't take it to heart.

40:11.154 --> 40:13.384
Hurry and have these dishes changed.

40:13.404 --> 40:15.314
- Yes.
- No need, Your Highness.

40:15.634 --> 40:18.124
Why call her Your Highness?

40:20.364 --> 40:21.724
Yes.

40:25.524 --> 40:26.884
Mother.

40:31.194 --> 40:32.544
Jin,

40:32.564 --> 40:35.084
before your mansion is decided,

40:35.444 --> 40:38.004
you may stay at Jinhua Hall for now.

40:38.274 --> 40:39.444
That way, you and your mother

40:39.444 --> 40:41.124
can spend more time together.

40:41.884 --> 40:44.164
There's still work at Capital Security.

40:44.634 --> 40:47.274
It's more convenient for me
to stay at my residence.

40:47.444 --> 40:49.314
Then when you have time,

40:49.964 --> 40:52.674
visit Prince Qi often.

40:53.044 --> 40:54.444
Your brother

40:54.754 --> 40:56.924
will surely take good care of you.

40:57.044 --> 40:58.404
Of course.

41:14.044 --> 41:16.084
(With Commandant Yu's temperament, )

41:16.324 --> 41:18.524
(if he truly angered His Majesty, )

41:19.074 --> 41:21.074
(he might end up in serious trouble.)

41:23.014 --> 41:23.884
(Why didn't I)

41:23.884 --> 41:26.234
(warn him beforehand?)

41:26.524 --> 41:28.164
(He's always such a handful.)

41:37.364 --> 41:39.044
Where am I now?

42:03.004 --> 42:04.024
Come here.

42:04.044 --> 42:05.864
It can shelter you from the rain.

42:10.234 --> 42:11.594
Come on.

42:14.444 --> 42:15.804
Get up.

42:18.634 --> 42:20.564
Are you also lost?

42:24.444 --> 42:26.394
The rain is really coming down hard.

42:26.884 --> 42:28.834
The gates must be closing soon.

42:29.964 --> 42:31.834
You're leaving the Palace?

42:32.154 --> 42:33.514
Yes.

42:33.924 --> 42:35.964
Is it lively outside?

42:38.264 --> 42:42.624
(The End of Episode 23)

42:43.074 --> 42:44.804
♪ From place to place ♪

42:44.804 --> 42:49.744
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

42:50.114 --> 42:52.494
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

42:52.494 --> 42:56.724
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

42:57.434 --> 42:59.834
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

42:59.854 --> 43:03.514
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:03.534 --> 43:06.954
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:07.104 --> 43:12.624
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:13.444 --> 43:17.124
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:17.124 --> 43:21.204
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:21.444 --> 43:23.184
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:23.204 --> 43:27.904
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:27.904 --> 43:31.474
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:31.494 --> 43:35.724
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:35.744 --> 43:37.524
♪ Time glows ♪

43:37.524 --> 43:42.064
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:42.084 --> 43:46.884
♪ And stars ♪

43:51.114 --> 43:53.644
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

43:53.664 --> 43:57.284
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

43:57.304 --> 44:00.734
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:00.754 --> 44:05.374
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:05.374 --> 44:09.064
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:09.084 --> 44:13.174
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:13.284 --> 44:15.104
♪ Time glows ♪

44:15.104 --> 44:19.654
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:19.674 --> 44:23.374
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:23.394 --> 44:27.554
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:27.734 --> 44:29.494
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:29.494 --> 44:34.014
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:34.014 --> 44:37.654
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:37.674 --> 44:43.344
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:45.034 --> 44:46.964
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:46.964 --> 44:54.464
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
